---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Philosophy">
  <div class="narrow">
    <h1 class="visually-hidden">Philosophy</h1>
    <div class="prose intro">
      <p>It’s an absolute privilege to be working on the web today.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>The web will win</h2>
      <p>HTML, CSS &amp; JavaScript will be used to create web applications for a long time. There are so many strengths that make it an ideal development platform.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Huge developer &amp; user base</li>
        <li>Open technologies</li>
        <li>No installation required</li>
        <li>Adaptive to users’ displays</li>
        <li>Fast &amp; easy to develop</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Regardless of the platform or device, web browsers can adapt your content to the users’ needs.</p>
      <h2>Simple, focused software is the future</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Small focused teams working collaboratively</li>
        <li>Focus on the core of the application and make that ridiculously good</li>
        <li>Keep code as simple as possible and avoid preferences</li>
      </ul>
      <p><a href="https://basecamp.com/gettingreal">37signals were right</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
